  m_Name: ending_takeover
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ExitClause.Story.EndingDefinition
  id: ending_takeover
  title: The New Handler
  epilogue: 'Nobody announces it. The phones simply start ringing for Adrian instead of Marcus.


    The pensions stay where they are. The contracts keep their clause. Somewhere, a young agent signs on the line without reading it.


    The agency never lets anyone retire. Now it is his.'
  lovedOneSavedLine: Sofia leaves the Riviera without a goodbye. She saw his face on the pier. She knew.
  lovedOneLostLine: There is no one left to disappoint. That makes the job easier.
  informantLine: Nadia Roux is the first name he crosses out.
  minEvidence: 0
  minRageUses: 3
  requiresNoSpare: 1
